Third-party works whose code this project was translated from
==============================================================

================================================================================
SLEEF — SIMD Library for Evaluating Elementary Functions
https://github.com/shibatch/sleef
================================================================================

The kernels in `src/f64x/` and `src/tables.rs` are close translations of SLEEF's
vector math routines as re-expressed by `sleef-rs` (see below). The algorithms,
the range reductions, the polynomial coefficients and the Payne–Hanek reduction
tables originate in SLEEF.

Upstream file mapping (sleef-rs rev 3671d46 -> this crate):

  src/f64x.rs             -> src/f64x/mod.rs, src/common.rs
  src/f64x/constants.rs   -> src/f64x/constants.rs, src/constants.rs
  src/f64x/u05.rs         -> src/f64x/u05.rs
  src/f64x/u10.rs         -> src/f64x/u10.rs
  src/f64x/u15.rs         -> src/f64x/u15.rs
  src/f64x/u35.rs         -> src/f64x/u35.rs
  src/tables.rs           -> src/tables.rs (verbatim data)
  doubled v0.3.3          -> src/doubled.rs

